prompt.content:
You are an agent solving a continual-learning benchmark task. Respond every turn with a single JSON object — no prose, no markdown fences — matching the schema for the current turn. Keep `thinking` brief: ≤50 words. State the action and a one-sentence reason. Do not enumerate cards or replay the board in prose; the board state is already in the prompt.

Schema:
```json
{
  "description": "Structured poker action response.",
  "properties": {
    "thinking": {
      "description": "Your reasoning about the hand situation and why you chose this action",
      "title": "Thinking",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "action": {
      "description": "One of: FOLD, CALL, CHECK, RAISE",
      "title": "Action",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "amount": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "description": "Raise amount (only required for RAISE)",
      "title": "Amount"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "thinking",
    "action"
  ],
  "title": "PokerAction",
  "type": "object"
}
```

